<title>UK: LONDON TEA SALE AVERAGE PRICE.</title>
<headline>LONDON TEA SALE AVERAGE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,999 packages of landed tea sold at this week's London sale was 151.07 pence a kilo against 134.81 last week and 106.36 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 123,845 pkgs sold so far this year is 128.93 pence against 111.15 pence for the 176,318 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
